#CarrierCorrection Yes
; Needs MucoMSX v1.5-Stable+ (MucoMSXExtension SCC parts, msPb0102).
; YM2151 FM -> OPNA FM: A=ch1 B=ch2 C=ch4 H=ch5 I=ch7 J=ch8
; YM2151 FM -> SCC wave+envelope: SCCA=ch3 SCCB=ch6
; K = MSM6258 ADPCM -> ADPCM-B (DETANATB.BIN)
; F = tempo only: Timer-B values alternate so 1 clock = 2 driver ticks

; SCC waves: steady-state shape of the YM2151 voices
